(text "CECE - BATTERY POWER + USB PROGRAMMING" (at 20.32 15.24 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54)) (justify left top)) (uuid "10f14760-ea37-48d4-9df1-3811f193b6b4"))
(text "Normal run: battery powers ESP + four SG90s | USB for programming only | Camera / mic / Wi-Fi retained" (at 20.32 22.86 0) (effects (font (size 1.35 1.35)) (justify left top)) (uuid "492dfc2f-0951-4947-ab31-a1af571e7359"))
(text "1. BATTERY / SWITCH / REGULATOR" (at 20.32 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d0e66ecb-d711-4d4e-92d1-300cd2bd1357"))
(text "2. CONTROLLER / SERVO SOCKETS" (at 241.3 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left top)) (uuid "a7d20970-57a2-4a04-90c3-45298ea8c26b"))
(text "Leave these three\ncontrol pins unwired." (at 76.2 27.94 0) (effects (font (size 0.95 0.95)) (justify left top)) (uuid "898e60bc-0677-407c-9cef-a4533e9950df"))
(text "Set and measure\n5.0V BEFORE connecting." (at 157.48 86.36 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "08a0bf24-bfe6-40e3-872f-214e1708166c"))
(text "C1 + to 5V; striped\nnegative side to GND." (at 195.58 99.06 0) (effects (font (size 1.05 1.05)) (justify left top)) (uuid "6c87ece1-7d8b-429c-b3ab-02913235390d"))
(text "3. ESP POWER + FOUR LOGIC WIRES" (at 20.32 119.38 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left top)) (uuid "a2944fba-1955-4f25-8665-bd304c28aa52"))
(text "Camera / mic on Sense add-on.\nUSB VBUS and 5V header are\ninternally common (ESP_5V)." (at 86.36 185.42 0) (effects (font (size 1.05 1.05)) (justify left top)) (uuid "3f46dd34-e3fe-48dd-aac6-bc0c21b031c2"))
(text "JP1: fitted to RUN; REMOVE before USB.\nD1 banded end -> ESP 5V header." (at 15.24 208.28 0) (effects (font (size 1.05 1.05)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d2c51e75-ecd8-4cc7-afa0-9b6958b794b7"))
(text "Both address switches OFF\nI2C address 0x44\nSockets 1/2 = hips; 3/4 = feet\nChip channels = 3/2/1/0" (at 246.38 162.56 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid "cbfec3cb-ab67-4951-a222-ca610ae39ede"))
(text "POWER / PROGRAMMING MODES\nRUN: no computer USB; JP1 fitted; switch ON.\nBattery -> switch -> UBEC 5V -> servos AND ESP.\nESP branch: JP1 -> D1 -> ESP 5V header.\nPROGRAM: switch OFF; REMOVE JP1; then plug USB.\nAfter programming: unplug USB, then refit JP1.\nD1 alone does NOT prevent PC backfeed; remove JP1.\nNever connect 2S pack directly to ESP 5V or BAT+.\nAll GND labels share ground. Use proper power wire." (at 20.32 220.98 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c9019fec-9e6a-45ff-a9cf-d4b915bcf5e9"))
(text "BATTERY HAS TWO SEPARATE CONNECTORS\nMain 2-wire lead: RED = pack +; BLACK = pack -.\nMain lead supplies the switch / UBEC as drawn above.\n3-wire BLACK / BLUE / RED plug = 2S balance lead.\nBalance functions: pack -, cell midpoint, pack +.\nWire-to-pin order is NOT verified: do not wire by colour.\nMidpoint is NOT ground; never join it to GND." (at 157.48 220.98 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid "2f9ae30d-4dca-4e06-8257-eeb0be100b46"))
(text "CHARGER CONNECTION - PENDING IDENTIFICATION\nUnplug MAIN lead from robot before charging.\nUse a charger explicitly rated for 2S LiPo (8.4V full).\nBalance plug -> charger 2S balance socket, after pin check.\nSome chargers ALSO need main red/black charge leads;\nothers charge through the balance plug alone.\nExact connections require charger model + plug photos.\nDo NOT use an unverified Adafruit 1S USB-C charger.\nESP USB and UBEC do not charge this pack." (at 294.64 185.42 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "51d535b0-879a-4974-a1e0-4c4e9a00981d"))
(text "MODULE DRAWING\nFollow printed terminal labels, not block positions.\nModule wiring only; no physical footprint mapping.\nSwitch is ON/OFF, not safety isolation." (at 294.64 243.84 0) (effects (font (size 1.05 1.05)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f7e2fd7f-46d1-4cf6-86f9-5a8490100674"))
)
